old='''<p class="note">Individual target percentages are compared against the total portfolio value recorded in FinMate. Review suitability before acting.</p></div></details>`},'''
new='''<p class="note">Individual target percentages are compared against the total portfolio value recorded in FinMate. Review suitability before acting.</p>${this.sectorRebalancePlanner()}</div></details>`},'''
